          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You have line of effect to your familiar.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Under your tutelage, your familiar has grown attuned to the hidden currents of the world and can serve as a conduit for your magic. If the next action you use is to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Cast a Spell] that has a range, the spell uses the familiar as its origin point.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 4
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "Familiar Master Dedication"
              },
              {
                "value": "able to cast spells"
              }
            ]
          },
